{"content":"The pass is blocked until day 5 (today is day 1). Pushing at the rocks is wasted time. Best plan: read the notice board (confirms schedule, useful info), then spend the days productively farming the meadow soil, and be ready at the pass on day 5.","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_QM5u4APXtuQhuTylY0Vy8012","name":"submit_plan","args":{"approach":"Rockslide Pass is impassable until day 5 (wiki + notice board); instead of wasting time pushing rocks, read the notice board, then till/plant/water parsnips in the meadow soil to pass the days, and stage near the pass gap (11,3) so we can head north the moment it opens.","steps":[{"kind":"walk_to","x":4,"y":7,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":3,"y":7,"button":"left"},{"kind":"wait","minutes":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":8,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":8,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":8,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":8,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":8,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":8,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":10,"y":5,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"wait","minutes":5}]}}],"ms":3452,"cached":false,"usage":{"prompt":1990,"completion":783}}